  "goodToKnow": "Der Geschirrspüler is a dishwasher, also die Spülmaschine. Dishes that can go in it are spülmaschinenfest. Das Geschirr means dishes and also a horse's harness. Washing up by hand is abwaschen or spülen, and the person who does it in a restaurant is der Spüler or Tellerwäscher: vom Tellerwäscher zum Millionär (from rags to riches). The plural is the same."
